      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effectiveness of treatment of 127 elderly and senile patients suffering from the ischemic heart disease, who underwent the endoscopic interventions for acute cholecystitis, have been analysed. Atraumaticity of endoscopic interventions, individual approach to the choice of a method for treatment of a patient and agreed with a therapeutist preoperative preparation, including prescription of the coronaro-active agents, cardiac glycosides, permitted in the majority of patients to achieve a positive result of treatment."},
